analytics (1.0.3-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  [ Critical fixes ]
  * Fix package upgrades disabling the service (prerm disabled on upgrade,
    postinst never re-enabled) — the service died at the next reboot after
    any .deb upgrade
  * Fix tracker engagement undercounting: report engagement as deltas and
    send a final 'engagement' event when the page becomes hidden/unloaded
  * Fix rate-limit bypass: ignore client-supplied X-Real-IP (spoofable;
    only the right-most X-Forwarded-For entry is trusted now)
  * Fix SQLite pragmas (synchronous, cache_size, temp_store) applying to
    only one pooled connection — moved into the DSN

  [ Correctness ]
  * Idempotent ingestion: events carry a dedup key, retries no longer
    double-count pageviews/sessions/aggregates (migration 002)
  * Fix bounce counter drift: sessions store a bounce flag so the un-bounce
    transition happens exactly once
  * Retention now prunes the sessions table too (raw per-visitor data)
  * Drop dead columns page_stats.exits and daily_stats.avg_engagement
  * Rune-safe truncation of long URLs/referrers/user agents
  * Fix dashboard "clear API key" throwing ReferenceError (out-of-scope
    apiKeyBtn) and skipping the data reload
  * Dashboard: scrub api_key from the URL after reading it
  * Dashboard: relabel "Visiteurs uniques" to "Nouvelles sessions"
    (matches what the aggregate actually counts)
  * Tracker: honor Global Privacy Control alongside DNT
  * Log HTTP status code and client IP; package the systemd memory limit
    drop-in; document missing env vars

 -- Robin Dubreuil <robin@dubreuil.pro>  Wed, 25 Nov 2026 21:30:00 +0100

analytics (1.0.2-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Fix bounce rate permanently inflated (read session before upsert)
  * Fix page_stats.avg_engagement off-by-one formula
  * Fix page_stats.sessions inflation on page revisit
  * Add SQLite busy_timeout(5000) to reduce SQLITE_BUSY errors
  * Run retention job immediately on startup (not after 24h delay)
  * Add rate limiting to dashboard API endpoints
  * Remove ?api_key= from dashboard auth (header only)
  * Fix parseIP mangling bare IPv6 addresses
  * Add Vary: Origin to CORS responses
  * Narrow isBusyError matching (remove overly broad "(5)" pattern)
  * Add retry jitter to StoreEvents backoff
  * Fix config.Load() to handle -h/--help and parse errors
  * Return 0 count on StoreEvents error (not partially-inserted count)
  * Fix tracker: reset engagement/scroll on SPA pageview()
  * Fix tracker: dispose() now flushes before marking disposed
  * Remove ExecReload (server doesn't handle SIGHUP)
  * Dockerfile: multi-arch build, CGO_ENABLED=0, includes dashboard SPA
  * Release workflow: fix changelog version substitution
  * Delete dead schema.sql, clean up dashboard dead code/imports
  * Add debian/copyright, fix inert logrotate config
  * Fix Makefile install path (/usr/local/bin → /usr/bin)

 -- Robin Dubreuil <robin@dubreuil.pro>  Sat, 08 Aug 2026 23:00:00 +0200

